#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:4
msgid "Container images"
msgstr "容器镜像"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:6
msgid ""
"Each :ref:`profile <deployment-docker>` builds a different image. They "
"differ in what simulation and rendering stack they carry, which decides how "
"large they are and what they can run. This page describes the images "
"themselves; to build or run one, name its profile in the :ref:`container "
"lifecycle <container-lifecycle>`."
msgstr ""
"每种 :ref:`配置 <deployment-docker>` "
"构建不同镜像。它们所包含的仿真与渲染栈不同，决定镜像大小及可运行内容。本页介绍镜像本身；构建或运行时，在 :ref:`容器生命周期 "
"<container-lifecycle>` 中指定其配置名称。"

