msgstr "使用 Newton 训练，希望镜像尽量小；也是唯一没有 Isaac Sim EULA 的镜像"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:32
msgid "Base image"
msgstr "基础镜像"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:34
msgid ""
"``Dockerfile.base`` overlays Isaac Lab's dependencies onto the Isaac Sim "
"container, so it inherits Kit, RTX rendering, and the Isaac Sim asset "
"pipeline. The Isaac Sim version it builds against is set by "
"``ISAACSIM_VERSION`` in ``.env.base``; the other variables in that file "
"control paths inside the container."
msgstr ""
"``Dockerfile.base`` 在 Isaac Sim 容器上添加 Isaac Lab 依赖，因此继承 Kit、RTX 渲染和 Isaac "
"Sim 资产管线。构建所用 Isaac Sim 版本由 ``.env.base`` 中的 ``ISAACSIM_VERSION`` "
"指定；该文件的其他变量控制容器内路径。"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:40
msgid "ROS 2 image"
msgstr "ROS 2 镜像"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:42
msgid ""
"``Dockerfile.ros2`` installs ROS 2 Humble from an `apt package`_ and sources"
" it in the runtime user's ``.bashrc``. ``ROS2_APT_PACKAGE`` in ``.env.ros2``"
" selects the package set, defaulting to ``ros-base``. The image defaults to "
"the ``FastRTPS`` middleware; ``CycloneDDS`` is also supported, and both can "
"be `tuned`_ through their ``.xml`` files under ``docker/.ros``. See `various"
" middleware`_ for the trade-offs."
msgstr ""
"``Dockerfile.ros2`` 通过 `apt 软件包 <apt package_>`_ 安装 ROS 2 Humble，并在运行时用户的 "
"``.bashrc`` 中加载其环境。 ``.env.ros2`` 的 ``ROS2_APT_PACKAGE`` 选择软件包集合，默认为 ``ros-"
"base`` 。镜像默认使用 ``FastRTPS`` 中间件，也支持 ``CycloneDDS`` 。二者均可通过 ``docker/.ros`` "
"下的 ``.xml`` 文件 `调优 <tuned_>`_ ，取舍见 `不同中间件 <various middleware_>`_ 。"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:0
msgid "Parameters in .env.ros2"
msgstr ".env.ros2 中的参数"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:55
msgid "Kit-less image"
msgstr "不依赖 Kit 的镜像"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:57
msgid ""
"The kit-less image drops Isaac Sim entirely and builds on Ubuntu 24.04 with "
"Python 3.12. It carries Newton physics, OVPhysX physics, OVRTX rendering, "
"and the four core RL frameworks: RL Games, RSL-RL, Stable-Baselines3, and "
"SKRL. The ``newton_gl``, ``newton_rtx``, ``viser``, and ``rerun`` "
"visualizers are included. Use ``--viz newton_gl`` for local visualization "
"with a display available in the container. ``--viz newton_gl`` selects the "
"OpenGL rasterizer; ``--viz newton_rtx`` selects the OVRTX path tracer. Both "
"can render offscreen without Isaac Sim. Windowed use additionally needs a "
"display server accessible inside the container. The deprecated ``--viz "
"newton`` alias selects GL; it does not choose between GL and RTX "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"此镜像完全移除 Isaac Sim，基于 Ubuntu 24.04 和 Python 3.12 构建。它包含 Newton 物理、OVPhysX "
"物理、OVRTX 渲染，以及 RL Games、RSL-RL、Stable-Baselines3、SKRL 四种核心强化学习框架，也包含 "
"``newton_gl`` 、 ``newton_rtx`` 、 ``viser`` 和 ``rerun`` 可视化器。容器可访问显示器时，使用 "
"``--viz newton_gl`` 进行本地可视化。 ``--viz newton_gl`` 选择 OpenGL 光栅化器， ``--viz "
"newton_rtx`` 选择 OVRTX 路径追踪器；两者都可不依赖 Isaac Sim 进行离屏渲染。窗口模式还要求容器内可访问显示服务器。已弃用的"
" ``--viz newton`` 别名选择 GL，不会自动在 GL 和 RTX 之间选择。"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:66
msgid ""
"Rendering needs NVIDIA graphics driver capabilities in addition to compute. "
"For direct ``docker run`` commands, pass ``--gpus all -e "
"NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=all``. The NVIDIA Container Toolkit exposes the "
"host driver; avoid mounting a second copy of its Vulkan ICD. If multiple "
"drivers are discovered, select the NVIDIA ICD available inside the container"
" with ``VK_DRIVER_FILES`` (for example, "
"``/etc/vulkan/icd.d/nvidia_icd.json``)."
msgstr ""
"除计算能力外，渲染还需要 NVIDIA 图形驱动能力。直接使用 ``docker run`` 时，传入 ``--gpus all -e "
"NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=all`` 。NVIDIA Container Toolkit 会提供宿主机驱动，不要再挂载一份 "
"Vulkan ICD。如果发现多个驱动，通过 ``VK_DRIVER_FILES`` 选择容器内可用的 NVIDIA ICD，例如 "
"``/etc/vulkan/icd.d/nvidia_icd.json`` 。"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:72
msgid ""
"No visualizer is selected by default, so training runs headless unless you "
"ask for one. The ``kit`` visualizer is the exception: it comes from "
"Omniverse Kit, which this image does not contain."
msgstr ""
"默认不选择可视化器，因此除非显式请求，训练以无界面模式运行。 ``kit`` 可视化器不可用，因为它来自本镜像未包含的 Omniverse Kit。"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:76
msgid ""
"Unlike the other two, it bind-mounts ``apps`` in addition to ``source``, "
"``scripts``, ``tools``, and ``docs``, and it keeps a uv cache and a Warp "
"cache of its own."
msgstr ""
"与另两种镜像相比，它除了绑定挂载 ``source`` 、 ``scripts`` 、 ``tools`` 和 ``docs`` ，还挂载 "
"``apps`` ，并维护独立的 uv 与 Warp 缓存。"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:79
msgid ""
"You do not have to build it locally. It is published alongside each Isaac "
"Lab release in the same registry repository, distinguished by a ``-kitless``"
" tag suffix:"
msgstr "无需在本地构建。它随每个 Isaac Lab 版本发布在同一镜像仓库，用 ``-kitless`` 标签后缀区分："

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:86
msgid ""
"Running it directly, outside the Compose workflow, is a convenient way to "
"verify the image and your NVIDIA Container Toolkit setup. ``--interactive`` "
"and ``--tty`` keep the container's shell alive so that several commands can "
"share it. The ``isaac-lab-kitless-logs`` named volume keeps checkpoints "
"after the container is removed:"
msgstr ""
"脱离 Compose 工作流程直接运行镜像，便于验证镜像和 NVIDIA Container Toolkit 配置。``--interactive`` "
"和 ``--tty`` 会保持容器 shell 运行，以便多条命令共用同一个容器。``isaac-lab-kitless-logs`` "
"命名卷可在容器删除后保留检查点："

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:102
msgid "Replay in a browser with:"
msgstr "通过以下命令在浏览器中回放："

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:110
msgid ""
"Viser is reachable through the host network without forwarding a desktop "
"display. Stop playback with ``Ctrl+C`` without stopping the container. Copy "
"the logs to the host with ``docker cp isaac-lab-"
"kitless:/workspace/isaaclab/logs ./logs``. To build the image from the "
"checkout instead of pulling it, run ``docker build --file "
"docker/Dockerfile.kitless --tag isaac-lab-kitless .``."
msgstr ""
"Viser 可通过宿主机网络访问，无需转发桌面显示。用 ``Ctrl+C`` 停止回放不会停止容器。可用 ``docker cp isaac-lab-"
"kitless:/workspace/isaaclab/logs ./logs`` 将日志复制到宿主机。需要从当前工作副本构建镜像而不是拉取镜像时，运行"
" ``docker build --file docker/Dockerfile.kitless --tag isaac-lab-kitless "
".``。"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:116
msgid ""
"Check which architectures a tag publishes with ``docker buildx imagetools "
"inspect <image:tag>`` before choosing a host."
msgstr ""
"选择宿主机前，使用 ``docker buildx imagetools inspect <image:tag>`` 检查该标签发布了哪些架构的镜像。"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:120
msgid "Pre-built image from NGC"
msgstr "NGC 预构建镜像"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:122
msgid ""
"A minimal pre-built container carries a small set of Isaac Sim and Omniverse"
" dependencies with Isaac Lab already built in, under "
"``/workspace/isaaclab``. The example below runs without a forwarded desktop "
"display. Choose the image profile for the physics and rendering stack you "
"need, and configure graphics access separately when rendering."
msgstr ""
"精简的预构建容器包含少量 Isaac Sim 和 Omniverse 依赖，并已在 ``/workspace/isaaclab`` 中内置 Isaac "
"Lab。以下示例无需转发桌面显示。根据所需物理与渲染栈选择镜像配置，渲染时另行配置图形访问。"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:129
msgid ""
"Use an explicit published version tag for reproducible runs. The examples "
"below use ``3.0.0-rc1``; the corresponding kit-less image uses "
"``3.0.0-rc1-kitless``."
msgstr ""
"使用明确的已发布版本标签，以便复现运行。下例使用 ``3.0.0-rc1`` ，对应的不依赖 Kit 的镜像标签为 "
"``3.0.0-rc1-kitless`` 。"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:134
msgid ""
"Images from 3.0.0-beta2 onward run as a **non-root** user, so those bind-"
"mount directories must be writable by uid/gid 1000. Docker creates any "
"missing one as ``root``, which the runtime user cannot write to, producing "
"errors such as ``PermissionError: [Errno 13] Permission denied: "
"'/root/.local/share/ov/data/exts'``. Create them first:"
msgstr ""
"从 3.0.0-beta2 开始，镜像以 **非 root** 用户运行，因此绑定挂载目录必须允许 uid/gid 1000 写入。Docker 会以 "
"``root`` 创建不存在的目录，运行时用户无法写入，可能出现 ``PermissionError: [Errno 13] Permission "
"denied: '/root/.local/share/ov/data/exts'`` 等错误。应先创建目录："

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:145
msgid ""
"Because it is run outside Compose, the Isaac Sim cache directories have to "
"be mounted by hand, otherwise every start recompiles shaders:"
msgstr "由于在 Compose 之外运行，需手动挂载 Isaac Sim 缓存目录，否则每次启动都重新编译着色器："

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:162
msgid ""
"For windowed use, follow the X11 setup in :ref:`deployment-docker`; the "
"container needs access to the host display and matching authorization. For "
"direct ``docker run`` use, add ``-e DISPLAY -e "
"XAUTHORITY=/tmp/isaaclab.xauth`` and the mounts ``-v "
"/tmp/.X11-unix:/tmp/.X11-unix:rw`` and ``-v "
"\"${XAUTHORITY:-$HOME/.Xauthority}\":/tmp/isaaclab.xauth:ro`` to the command"
" above. The host authority file must exist and be readable by the container "
"user. Offscreen Newton rendering does not require X11. Follow the graphics-"
"driver requirements above for GL or RTX."
msgstr ""
"窗口模式按 :ref:`deployment-docker` 配置 X11；容器需要访问宿主机显示，并获得相应授权。直接使用 ``docker "
"run`` 时，在上述命令中加入 ``-e DISPLAY -e XAUTHORITY=/tmp/isaaclab.xauth`` ，以及挂载 ``-v"
" /tmp/.X11-unix:/tmp/.X11-unix:rw`` 和 ``-v "
"\"${XAUTHORITY:-$HOME/.Xauthority}\":/tmp/isaaclab.xauth:ro`` "
"。宿主机授权文件必须存在，且容器用户可读取。Newton 离屏渲染无需 X11。GL 或 RTX 应遵循上述图形驱动要求。"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:171
msgid "Runtime user"
msgstr "运行时用户"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:173
msgid ""
"The base, ROS 2, cuRobo, and kit-less images all run as a non-root user with"
" uid/gid 1000. When running one of these images directly with ``docker "
"run``, keep that default user instead of passing ``--user``, so that the "
"runtime home and cache directories stay writable. Named volumes inherit the "
"image's ownership; make host bind mounts writable with ``sudo chown -R "
"1000:1000 <directory>``."
msgstr ""
"基础、ROS 2、cuRobo 和不依赖 Kit 的镜像都以 uid/gid 为 1000 的非 root 用户运行。通过 ``docker run``"
" 直接运行这些镜像时，应保留默认用户，不传入 "
"``--user``，以保证运行时主目录和缓存目录可写。命名卷继承镜像中的属主设置；宿主机绑定挂载的目录可通过 ``sudo chown -R "
"1000:1000 <directory>`` 设置为该用户可写。"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:179
msgid "Python interpreter"
msgstr "Python 解释器"

#: source/workflows/docker/images.rst:181
msgid ""
"Every image installs from ``uv.lock`` into a Python 3.12 virtual environment"
" at ``/opt/isaaclab-venv``. On the Isaac Sim-based images the environment is"
" built on Isaac Sim's own interpreter, and Isaac Sim itself stays outside "
"it, reached through the ``_isaac_sim`` symlink; ``isaaclab.sh`` puts it on "
"the path. In either case ``python`` on the container's ``PATH`` resolves to "
"the right one, so scripts are run the same way regardless of image."
msgstr ""
"各镜像均根据 ``uv.lock`` ，将依赖安装到 ``/opt/isaaclab-venv`` 下的 Python 3.12 虚拟环境。基于 "
"Isaac Sim 的镜像使用 Isaac Sim 自带解释器构建环境；Isaac Sim 本身位于环境之外，通过 ``_isaac_sim`` "
"符号链接访问，由 ``isaaclab.sh`` 加入路径。所有镜像中，容器 ``PATH`` 上的 ``python`` "
"都指向正确解释器，因此运行脚本的方式相同。"
